    "label": "Workshop — Whether you have a question, a suggestion, or ju",
    "type": "html",
    "value": "Whether you have a question, a suggestion, or just want to say hello, this is the place to do\n                                it. Please fill out the form below with your details and message, and we'll get back to you\n                                as soon as possible.",
