  {
    "key": "workshop.text.21",
    "page": "workshop",
    "label": "Workshop — At Hypersonic Tech Speed, we are passionate abou",
    "type": "text",
    "value": "At Hypersonic Tech Speed, we are passionate about engineering high-performance exhaust systems that\n                        elevate driving experiences. Since our beginning, we’ve committed ourselves to precision\n                        craftsmanship, using premium materials and advanced technology to deliver exhaust solutions that\n                        maximize power, sound, and durability.",
    "sort_order": 1021
  },
  {
    "key": "workshop.text.22",
    "page": "workshop",
    "label": "Workshop — We believe performance upgrades should be powerf",
    "type": "text",
    "value": "We believe performance upgrades should be powerful and reliable. That’s why we design and manufacture\n                        precision exhaust systems, from daily-driver solutions to high-performance racing setups-each\n                        tailored to your vehicle’s needs. With a focus on innovation, durability, and driving satisfaction,\n                        Hypersonic Tech Speed is your trusted partner in maximizing power, sound, and style on every\n                        journey.",
    "sort_order": 1022
  },
  {
